<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What role does schema markup play in brand consistency?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Schema markup provides structured data that AI engines can reliably interpret, including organization details, product information, and FAQ content. This reduces misinterpretation and helps maintain consistent brand representation.</p>
