<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How often should I audit brand messaging across AI engines?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Conduct comprehensive audits monthly, with weekly spot checks on critical brand queries. Major product launches or competitive changes may require immediate audits to ensure consistent messaging.</p>
